      "status": "implemented",
      "facts": "facts/AVFoundation/AVSpeech.md",
      "reason": "the host names ar-SA as ar-001 and zh-Hans-CN as cmn-CN; the port answers the release's own codes (zh-CN, ar-SA). Pinned as divergences in voice-checks.m",
      "source": "SDK 16.4, AVFAudio; tests/backports/host/avf-speech/voice-checks.m"
    },
    {
      "api": "+[AVSpeechSynthesisVoice voiceWithLanguage:]",
