      "minimum": "6.0",
      "status": "implemented",
      "facts": "facts/AVFoundation/AVSpeech.md",
      "reason": "the list is the release's (36 codes), so the host's 180 voices are not the port's; a bare language answers as the host does, the current language first. Pinned as divergences in voice-checks.m (ar)",
